        "id": "spacing-root-gap-collapse",
        "component": "sm-hero-root",
        "severity": "high",
        "detail": "Measured in the native render at 1440, 768 and 390px, the eyebrow, heading, intro and button sit flush with no block spacing (for example, the eyebrow ends at y=127 where the heading starts, and the heading ends at y=268 where the intro starts). The root group declares gap but the constrained contentWidth layout does not apply it. The reference shows about 30px between eyebrow and title and about 30px between title and intro. Wrap the content in an inner flex group so the group gap acts as block spacing, or use equivalent native spacing, and re-measure.",
        "source": "model"
      },
