        "detail": "Measured native section height is 544px at 1440, 435px at 768 and 397px at 390. The reference is 608, 483 and 427px. The plan has no minHeight, so the hero is shorter and its vertical rhythm differs from the approved reference. Add a supported group minHeight (for example a vh/clamp value) that matches the reference proportions at 1440, 768 and 390px, then re-measure.",
        "source": "model"
